#: components/SafeRollout/Results/ResultsTable.tsx
msgid "Guardrails are either within bounds or failing. Once a guardrail is statistically significant in the undesirable direction, the status is changed to failing. All safe rollouts use frequentist sequential testing to enable reverting issues as soon as they appear without increased false positive rates."
